{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wPQsgrFFBh1795392628.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天元醫療接獲聯交所通知，公司股份將於下月2日暫停買賣，理由是公司未能維持足夠的業務運作，及擁有相當價值的資產，以支持營運。</p><p></p><p>公司過去五年均錄得淨虧損，並已停運整形外科手術業務與輕醫美業務。聯交所認為，公司剩餘的商標特許權業務、護膚品分銷業務及放債業務規模有限，新購入或成立的體檢業務，與健康管理業務規模細小，且在集團內營運歷史不長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:23:29.025243+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.333908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:17:14.793315+00:00","content_hash":"9d23b17e2f3eb760aad9ef4a767d1b046fd6e957bd949b1056884c3faae8cf16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:23:29.025243+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}